{"id": "dabe358d-7317-4cfc-86b7-3d1cd642828e", "slug": "aether-real-time-telemetry-engine", "title": "Aether — Real-Time Telemetry Engine", "description": "Aether Real Dashboard Section is designed for demonstrating application workflows and interface hierarchy. Key features include clear information density, modular panels, and interface rhythm. It is suitable for product showcases, admin panels, and analytics experiences.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-staff-featured-2026-05-22\"\nname: \"Aether — Real-Time Telemetry Engine\"\ndescription: \"Aether Real Dashboard Section is designed for demonstrating application workflows and interface hierarchy. Key features include clear information density, modular panels, and interface rhythm. It is suitable for product showcases, admin panels, and analytics experiences.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#10B981\"\n  secondary: \"#050A07\"\n  accent: \"#10B981\"\n  background: \"#030705\"\n  surface: \"#18181B\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#27272A\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"15px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Aether — Real-Time Telemetry Engine\nSource: Neuform staff featured templates. Author: Vanh DesignCode (@vanh). Views: 95; favorites: 10; remixes: 3.\nTags: dashboard, animated, threejs, cta, charts, security, billing, links.\n## Overview\nAether Real Dashboard Section is designed for demonstrating application workflows and interface hierarchy. Key features include clear information density, modular panels, and interface rhythm. It is suitable for product showcases, admin panels, and analytics experiences.\n\nAETHER Engine Online Quantum Telemetry Fine-tune, analyze, and deploy micro-latency streaming metrics over secure, zero-overhead mesh fabrics instantly. Signal Frequency 0.9 Hz Aggregation Pipeline P99 Sliding Windows M…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Quantum Telemetry.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #10B981, secondary #050A07, accent #10B981, background #030705, surface #18181B, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nDashboard, chart, and data panels should preserve their compact operational hierarchy, nested surfaces, and metric emphasis.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Aether — Real-Time Telemetry Engine</title>\n  \n  <!-- Tailwind CSS -->\n  <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n  \n  <!-- Iconify Scripts -->\n  <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n  \n  <!-- GSAP for Masked Reveal -->\n  <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n\n  <style>\n    *, *::before, *::after {\n      margin: 0;\n      padding: 0;\n      box-sizing: border-box;\n    }\n    \n    /* Custom scrollbar for high-fidelity logs container */\n    ::-webkit-scrollbar {\n      width: 4px;\n    }\n    ::-webkit-scrollbar-track {\n      background: transparent;\n    }\n    ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {\n      background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.2);\n      border-radius: 999px;\n    }\n    ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover {\n      background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.4);\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#030705] text-neutral-200 antialiased overflow-hidden min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center font-sans\">\n\n  <!-- Full-Screen Interactive Wave Canvas -->\n  <canvas id=\"waveCanvas\" class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full z-0 pointer-events-none\"></canvas>\n\n  <!-- Ambient Light Highlights -->\n  <div class=\"absolute top-1/4 left-1/4 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[500px] h-[500px] bg-emerald-500/5 rounded-full blur-[120px] pointer-events-none z-0\"></div>\n  <div class=\"absolute bottom-1/4 right-1/4 translate-x-1/2 translate-y-1/2 w-[500px] h-[500px] bg-amber-500/5 rounded-full blur-[120px] pointer-events-none z-0\"></div>\n\n  <!-- Main Viewport-Contained Dashboard Shell -->\n  <main class=\"relative z-10 w-full max-w-5xl px-4 md:px-8 flex flex-col items-center justify-center min-h-screen\">\n    \n    <!-- Header Area -->\n    <header class=\"w-full flex justify-between items-center mb-6 z-20\">\n      <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n        <div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-500/20 to-amber-500/10 border border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center justify-center\">\n          <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:bolt-circle-linear\" class=\"text-emerald-400\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\"></iconify-icon>\n        </div>\n        <span class=\"text-sm font-medium tracking-wider text-neutral-100\">AETHER</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-neutral-900/80 border border-neutral-800 backdrop-blur-md\">\n        <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 animate-pulse\"></span>\n        <span class=\"text-xs font-light text-neutral-400\">Engine Online</span>\n      </div>\n    </header>\n\n    <!-- Component Outer Shell (Subtle Gradient Border) -->\n    <div class=\"relative w-full p-[1px] rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-500/20 via-neutral-800/20 to-amber-500/15 overflow-hidden backdrop-blur-xl\">\n      \n      <!-- Component Inner Body -->\n      <div class=\"relative bg-[#050a07]/90 rounded-[15px] p-6 md:p-8 flex flex-col gap-6\">\n        \n        <!-- Grid Structure for Controls & Display -->\n        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-6 items-stretch\">\n          \n          <!-- Left Console Controls Panel (5 Columns) -->\n          <div class=\"md:col-span-5 flex flex-col justify-between gap-6 border-b md:border-b-0 md:border-r border-emerald-500/10 pb-6 md:pb-0 md:pr-6\">\n            \n            <div>\n              <!-- Masked Title Hook for GSAP -->\n              <div class=\"overflow-hidden\">\n                <h1 id=\"engineTitle\" class=\"text-2xl md:text-3xl font-light tracking-tight text-neutral-100 leading-tight mb-2\">\n                  Quantum <span class=\"bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-400 to-amber-300 bg-clip-text text-transparent font-medium\">Telemetry</span>\n                </h1>\n              </div>\n              <p class=\"text-xs text-neutral-400 font-light leading-relaxed max-w-sm\">\n                Fine-tune, analyze, and deploy micro-latency streaming metrics over secure, zero-overhead mesh fabrics instantly.\n              </p>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Custom Controls Block -->\n            <div class=\"space-y-5 my-2\">\n              \n              <!-- Control 1: Range Slider -->\n              <div class=\"space-y-2\">\n                <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center text-xs\">\n                  <span class=\"text-neutral-400 font-light\">Signal Frequency</span>\n                  <span id=\"freqVal\" class=\"text-emerald-400 font-mono\">0.9 Hz</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"relative flex items-center\">\n                  <input id=\"freqSlider\" type=\"range\" min=\"0.2\" max=\"2.5\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.9\" \n                    class=\"w-full h-1 bg-neutral-800 rounded-lg appearance-none cursor-pointer accent-emerald-500 focus:outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-emerald-500/30\">\n                </div>\n              </div>\n\n              <!-- Control 2: Custom Dropdown -->\n              <div class=\"space-y-2\">\n                <label class=\"block text-xs text-neutral-400 font-light\">Aggregation Pipeline</label>\n                <div class=\"relative\">\n                  <select id=\"pipelineSelect\" class=\"w-full bg-neutral-900 border border-emerald-500/10 text-neutral-300 text-xs rounded-lg px-3 py-2.5 appearance-none focus:outline-none focus:border-emerald-500/30 cursor-pointer pr-8\">\n                    <option value=\"p99\">P99 Sliding Windows</option>\n                    <option value=\"throughput\">Max Throughput Optimization</option>\n                    <option value=\"eco\">Balanced Energy Core</option>\n                  </select>\n                  <div class=\"absolute right-2.5 top-3 pointer-events-none text-neutral-500 flex items-center\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:alt-arrow-down-linear\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\"></iconify-icon>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n\n              <!-- Control 3: Custom Toggle Switches -->\n              <div class=\"space-y-3 pt-2\">\n                <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\">\n                  <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:shield-up-linear\" class=\"text-emerald-500/70\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"></iconify-icon>\n                    <span class=\"text-xs text-neutral-300 font-light\">Secure Packet Shielding</span>\n                  </div>\n                  <button onclick=\"toggleSwitch(this)\" id=\"shieldToggle\" class=\"relative inline-flex h-5 w-9 shrink-0 cursor-pointer rounded-full border border-neutral-700 bg-neutral-800 transition-colors duration-200 ease-in-out focus:outline-none\" role=\"switch\" aria-checked=\"true\">\n                    <span class=\"pointer-events-none inline-block h-4 w-4 transform rounded-full bg-emerald-400 shadow transition duration-200 ease-in-out translate-x-4\"></span>\n                  </button>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\">\n                  <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:routing-linear\" class=\"text-neutral-500\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"></iconify-icon>\n                    <span class=\"text-xs text-neutral-300 font-light\">Cross-Region Mesh Routing</span>\n                  </div>\n                  <button onclick=\"toggleSwitch(this)\" id=\"routingToggle\" class=\"relative inline-flex h-5 w-9 shrink-0 cursor-pointer rounded-full border border-neutral-700 bg-neutral-800 transition-colors duration-200 ease-in-out focus:outline-none\" role=\"switch\" aria-checked=\"false\">\n                    <span class=\"pointer-events-none inline-block h-4 w-4 transform rounded-full bg-neutral-500 shadow transition duration-200 ease-in-out translate-x-0\"></span>\n                  </button>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Action buttons -->\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n              <button class=\"flex-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-500 to-emerald-600 hover:from-emerald-400 hover:to-emerald-500 text-neutral-950 font-medium text-xs py-2.5 px-4 rounded-lg transition-all duration-300 flex items-center justify-center gap-2 shadow-lg shadow-emerald-500/10\">\n                <span>Deploy Engine</span>\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-linear\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\"></iconify-icon>\n              </button>\n              <button onclick=\"simulatePulse()\" class=\"px-3 py-2.5 bg-neutral-900 border border-neutral-800 hover:border-emerald-500/30 text-neutral-300 rounded-lg text-xs transition-colors flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:play-linear\" class=\"text-emerald-400\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\"></iconify-icon>\n                <span>Trigger Pulse</span>\n              </button>\n            </div>\n\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Right Interactive Monitor Panel (7 Columns) -->\n          <div class=\"md:col-span-7 flex flex-col justify-between gap-4\">\n            \n            <!-- Real-time Stats Grid -->\n            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-3 gap-3\">\n              <div class=\"bg-neutral-950/50 p-3 rounded-lg border border-neutral-800/60 flex flex-col\">\n                <span class=\"text-xs text-neutral-500 font-light mb-1\">P99 Latency</span>\n                <span id=\"statLatency\" class=\"text-base font-light text-neutral-100 font-mono tracking-tight\">4.82 ms</span>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"bg-neutral-950/50 p-3 rounded-lg border border-neutral-800/60 flex flex-col\">\n                <span class=\"text-xs text-neutral-500 font-light mb-1\">Throughput</span>\n                <span id=\"statThroughput\" class=\"text-base font-light text-emerald-400 font-mono tracking-tight\">284 K/s</span>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"bg-neutral-950/50 p-3 rounded-lg border border-neutral-800/60 flex flex-col\">\n                <span class=\"text-xs text-neutral-500 font-light mb-1\">Uptime SLA</span>\n                <span class=\"text-base font-light text-neutral-100 font-mono tracking-tight\">99.998%</span>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- telemetry graph sandbox / visualization representation -->\n            <div class=\"relative h-44 bg-neutral-950/70 border border-emerald-500/10 rounded-xl overflow-hidden p-4 flex flex-col justify-between\">\n              \n              <!-- Interactive Visual Grid lines -->\n              <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[linear-gradient(to_right,#0c1510_1px,transparent_1px),linear-gradient(to_bottom,#0c1510_1px,transparent_1px)] bg-[size:1.5rem_1.5rem] opacity-30\"></div>\n              \n              <!-- Telemetry Header -->\n              <div class=\"relative z-10 flex justify-between items-center\">\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                  <span class=\"flex h-2 w-2 relative\">\n                    <span class=\"animate-ping absolute inline-flex h-full w-full rounded-full bg-emerald-400 opacity-75\"></span>\n                    <span class=\"relative inline-flex rounded-full h-2 w-2 bg-emerald-500\"></span>\n                  </span>\n                  <span class=\"text-xs font-mono text-emerald-500/90 tracking-wider\">AETHER-STREAM-0</span>\n                </div>\n                <span class=\"text-[10px] text-neutral-500 font-mono uppercase tracking-widest\">Live Buffer Node</span>\n              </div>\n\n              <!-- Center dynamic canvas lines or pulse feedback loop overlay -->\n              <div class=\"absolute inset-x-0 bottom-4 top-10 flex items-end justify-center px-4\">\n                <div class=\"w-full h-full flex items-end gap-[3px]\">\n                  <!-- Loop generating micro telemetry bars -->\n                  <div class=\"bg-gradient-to-t from-emerald-500/10 to-emerald-400/80 w-full h-[60%] rounded-sm transition-all duration-300 bar\"></div>\n                  <div class=\"bg-gradient-to-t from-emerald-500/10 to-emerald-400/80 w-full h-[45%] rounded-sm transition-all duration-300 bar\"></div>\n                  <div class=\"bg-gradient-to-t from-emerald-500/10 to-emerald-400/80 w-full h-[70%] rounded-sm transition-all duration-300 bar\"></div>\n                  <div class=\"bg-gradient-to-t from-emerald-500/10 to-emerald-400/80 w-full h-[85%] rounded-sm transition-all duration-300 bar\"></div>\n                  <div class=\"bg-gradient-to-t from-emerald-500/10 to-emerald-400/80 w-full h-[30%] rounded-sm transition-all duration-300 bar\"></div>\n                  <div class=\"bg-gradient-to-t from-emerald-500/10 to-emerald-400/80 w-full h-[55%] rounded-sm transition-all duration-300 bar\"></div>\n                  <div class=\"bg-gradient-to-t from-emerald-500/10 to-amber-400/80 w-full h-[90%] rounded-sm transition-all duration-300 bar\"></div>\n                  <div class=\"bg-gradient-to-t from-emerald-500/10 to-emerald-400/80 w-full h-[65%] rounded-sm transition-all duration-300 bar\"></div>\n                  <div class=\"bg-gradient-to-t from-emerald-500/10 to-emerald-400/80 w-full h-[40%] rounded-sm transition-all duration-300 bar\"></div>\n                  <div class=\"bg-gradient-to-t from-emerald-500/10 to-emerald-400/80 w-full h-[50%] rounded-sm transition-all duration-300 bar\"></div>\n                  <div class=\"bg-gradient-to-t from-emerald-500/10 to-emerald-400/80 w-full h-[75%] rounded-sm transition-all duration-300 bar\"></div>\n                  <div class=\"bg-gradient-to-t from-emerald-500/10 to-emerald-400/80 w-full h-[80%] rounded-sm transition-all duration-300 bar\"></div>\n                  <div class=\"bg-gradient-to-t from-emerald-500/10 to-emerald-400/80 w-full h-[60%] rounded-sm transition-all duration-300 bar\"></div>\n                  <div class=\"bg-gradient-to-t from-emerald-500/10 to-emerald-400/80 w-full h-[45%] rounded-sm transition-all duration-300 bar\"></div>\n                  <div class=\"bg-gradient-to-t from-emerald-500/10 to-amber-400/80 w-full h-[70%] rounded-sm transition-all duration-300 bar\"></div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Console System Terminal Stream -->\n            <div class=\"bg-neutral-950/80 border border-neutral-900 rounded-xl p-4 flex flex-col gap-2 h-24 overflow-y-auto\">\n              <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 justify-between border-b border-neutral-900 pb-2\">\n                <span class=\"text-[10px] text-neutral-500 font-mono tracking-wider\">Engine Log Stream</span>\n                <span class=\"text-[10px] text-neutral-500 font-mono flex items-center gap-1\">\n                  <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:database-linear\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\"></iconify-icon> Buffer 100%\n                </span>\n              </div>\n              <div id=\"terminalBody\" class=\"font-mono text-[10px] text-neutral-400 space-y-1\">\n                <div><span class=\"text-neutral-600\">[08:42:15]</span> <span class=\"text-emerald-500/90\">AETHER Engine initialised</span>. TLS tunnels open.</div>\n                <div><span class=\"text-neutral-600\">[08:42:16]</span> Core configuration loaded with 0 latency deviations.</div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n          </div>\n\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Inline Telemetry Overview Stats & Bottom Badge -->\n        <div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-between items-center border-t border-emerald-500/10 pt-4 gap-4\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-6\">\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n              <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:global-linear\" class=\"text-emerald-500/80\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\"></iconify-icon>\n              <span class=\"text-xs text-neutral-400 font-light\">Global Routing Active</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n              <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:programming-linear\" class=\"text-amber-500/80\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\"></iconify-icon>\n              <span class=\"text-xs text-neutral-400 font-light\">gRPC Core 2.8</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <span class=\"text-[10px] text-neutral-600 font-mono\">MD-E2E-SHA256 SECURED</span>\n        </div>\n\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Small footer hint -->\n    <div class=\"mt-6 flex items-center gap-2 text-neutral-600\">\n      <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:mouse-linear\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\"></iconify-icon>\n      <span class=\"text-[10px] tracking-wider uppercase\">Interactive waves respond to cursor movement</span>\n    </div>\n\n  </main>\n\n  <!-- Interactive Logic & Background Canvas Wave Animation -->\n  <script>\n    // Background waves canvas setup\n    const canvas = document.getElementById('waveCanvas');\n    const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');\n    let w, h, dpr;\n    let mouseX = 0.5, mouseY = 0.5;\n    let targetMX = 0.5, targetMY = 0.5;\n    let time = 0;\n\n    // Organic Emerald and Golden Amber palette configuration\n    const waves = [\n      { freq: 0.7, amp: 0.08, phase: 0.0, speed: 0.12, yBase: 0.85, color: [16, 185, 129],  opacity: 0.15 }, // Emerald Layer 1\n      { freq: 1.0, amp: 0.06, phase: 0.7, speed: 0.18, yBase: 0.76, color: [5, 150, 105],  opacity: 0.18 }, // Deep Green Layer 2\n      { freq: 0.5, amp: 0.10, phase: 1.5, speed: 0.10, yBase: 0.68, color: [245, 158, 11],  opacity: 0.12 }, // Amber Layer 3\n      { freq: 1.3, amp: 0.04, phase: 2.2, speed: 0.22, yBase: 0.60, color: [16, 185, 129],  opacity: 0.20 }, // High-speed Emerald\n      { freq: 0.8, amp: 0.07, phase: 3.0, speed: 0.15, yBase: 0.52, color: [217, 119, 6],   opacity: 0.14 }, // Dark Amber Layer 5\n      { freq: 1.1, amp: 0.05, phase: 3.8, speed: 0.20, yBase: 0.44, color: [52, 211, 153],  opacity: 0.18 }, // Bright mint accent layer\n    ];\n\n    function resize() {\n      dpr = Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio || 1, 2);\n      w = window.innerWidth;\n      h = window.innerHeight;\n      canvas.width = w * dpr;\n      canvas.height = h * dpr;\n      canvas.style.width = w + 'px';\n      canvas.style.height = h + 'px';\n      ctx.setTransform(dpr, 0, 0, dpr, 0, 0);\n    }\n\n    function onMouseMove(e) {\n      targetMX = e.clientX / window.innerWidth;\n      targetMY = e.clientY / window.innerHeight;\n    }\n\n    function onTouchMove(e) {\n      if (e.touches.length > 0) {\n        targetMX = e.touches[0].clientX / window.innerWidth;\n        targetMY = e.touches[0].clientY / window.innerHeight;\n      }\n    }\n\n    function waveY(wave, t, time) {\n      const baseY = wave.yBase * h;\n      const s1 = Math.sin(t * Math.PI * 2 * wave.freq + wave.phase + time * wave.speed);\n      const s2 = Math.sin(t * Math.PI * 2 * wave.freq * 1.6 + wave.phase * 0.5 + time * wave.speed * 1.25) * 0.32;\n      const s3 = Math.sin(t * Math.PI * 2 * wave.freq * 2.8 + wave.phase * 1.1 + time * wave.speed * 0.75) * 0.10;\n      const combined = s1 + s2 + s3;\n\n      // Cursor movement feedback - deforms grid dynamics dynamically\n      const dx = t - mouseX;\n      const dy = (baseY / h) - mouseY;\n      const dist = Math.sqrt(dx * dx + dy * dy);\n      const influence = Math.exp(-dist * dist * 10) * 0.04 * h;\n\n      return baseY + combined * wave.amp * h + influence;\n    }\n\n    function drawWave(wave) {\n      const steps = Math.ceil(w / 3);\n      const r = wave.color[0], g = wave.color[1], b = wave.color[2];\n\n      ctx.beginPath();\n      ctx.moveTo(0, h);\n\n      for (let i = 0; i <= steps; i++) {\n        const t = i / steps;\n        const x = t * w;\n        const y = waveY(wave, t, time);\n        ctx.lineTo(x, y);\n      }\n\n      ctx.lineTo(w, h);\n      ctx.closePath();\n\n      const topY = wave.yBase * h - wave.amp * h * 1.5;\n      const grad = ctx.createLinearGradient(0, topY, 0, h);\n      grad.addColorStop(0, `rgba(${r},${g},${b},${wave.opacity})`);\n      grad.addColorStop(0.5, `rgba(${r},${g},${b},${wave.opacity * 0.4})`);\n      grad.addColorStop(1, `rgba(${r},${g},${b},0)`);\n      ctx.fillStyle = grad;\n      ctx.fill();\n\n      // Top edge highlight line\n      ctx.beginPath();\n      for (let i = 0; i <= steps; i++) {\n        const t = i / steps;\n        const x = t * w;\n        const y = waveY(wave, t, time);\n        if (i === 0) ctx.moveTo(x, y);\n        else ctx.lineTo(x, y);\n      }\n      ctx.strokeStyle = `rgba(${Math.min(r + 50, 255)},${Math.min(g + 50, 255)},${Math.min(b + 30, 255)},${wave.opacity * 0.85})`;\n      ctx.lineWidth = 1;\n      ctx.stroke();\n    }\n\n    function render() {\n      // Smooth out cursor tracker coordinates\n      mouseX += (targetMX - mouseX) * 0.05;\n      mouseY += (targetMY - mouseY) * 0.05;\n\n      time += 0.016;\n      ctx.clearRect(0, 0, w, h);\n\n      // Back-to-front rendering loop\n      for (let i = 0; i < waves.length; i++) {\n        drawWave(waves[i]);\n      }\n\n      requestAnimationFrame(render);\n    }\n\n    window.addEventListener('resize', resize);\n    window.addEventListener('mousemove', onMouseMove);\n    window.addEventListener('touchmove', onTouchMove, { passive: true });\n\n    // Initialize Layout & Loop\n    resize();\n    render();\n\n    // GSAP Masked Reveal for premium load sequence\n    document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", () => {\n      gsap.fromTo(\"#engineTitle\", \n        { y: \"100%\", opacity: 0 }, \n        { y: \"0%\", opacity: 1, duration: 1, ease: \"power4.out\", delay: 0.2 }\n      );\n    });\n\n    // Custom UI Components Interactive Logic\n    const freqSlider = document.getElementById('freqSlider');\n    const freqVal = document.getElementById('freqVal');\n    const statLatency = document.getElementById('statLatency');\n    const statThroughput = document.getElementById('statThroughput');\n    const terminalBody = document.getElementById('terminalBody');\n\n    // Live update waves speed/amp based on control slider\n    freqSlider.addEventListener('input', (e) => {\n      const val = parseFloat(e.target.value);\n      freqVal.textContent = val.toFixed(1) + ' Hz';\n      \n      // Update canvas wave configurations interactively\n      waves.forEach((w, index) => {\n        w.speed = (index + 1) * 0.08 * val;\n      });\n\n      // Update interactive values simulation dynamically\n      const syntheticLatency = (4.82 - (val * 0.8)).toFixed(2);\n      statLatency.textContent = syntheticLatency + ' ms';\n      \n      const syntheticThroughput = Math.round(284 * val);\n      statThroughput.textContent = syntheticThroughput + ' K/s';\n    });\n\n    // Toggle logic for sliders/switches without extra libraries\n    function toggleSwitch(btn) {\n      const isChecked = btn.getAttribute('aria-checked') === 'true';\n      const indicator = btn.querySelector('span');\n      const icon = btn.closest('div').querySelector('iconify-icon');\n\n      if (isChecked) {\n        btn.setAttribute('aria-checked', 'false');\n        btn.classList.replace('bg-neutral-800', 'bg-neutral-900');\n        indicator.classList.replace('translate-x-4', 'translate-x-0');\n        indicator.classList.replace('bg-emerald-400', 'bg-neutral-500');\n        logEvent(\"Secure Packet Shielding set to standby\");\n      } else {\n        btn.setAttribute('aria-checked', 'true');\n        btn.classList.replace('bg-neutral-900', 'bg-neutral-800');\n        indicator.classList.replace('translate-x-0', 'translate-x-4');\n        indicator.classList.replace('bg-neutral-500', 'bg-emerald-400');\n        logEvent(\"Secure Packet Shielding protocol activated\");\n      }\n    }\n\n    // Interactive bar chart randomized simulation\n    const bars = document.querySelectorAll('.bar');\n    setInterval(() => {\n      bars.forEach(bar => {\n        const randomHeight = Math.floor(Math.random() * 85) + 15;\n        bar.style.height = randomHeight + '%';\n      });\n    }, 450);\n\n    // Dynamic Live Console Log appending\n    function logEvent(message) {\n      const now = new Date();\n      const timeStr = `[${String(now.getHours()).padStart(2, '0')}:${String(now.getMinutes()).padStart(2, '0')}:${String(now.getSeconds()).padStart(2, '0')}]`;\n      const div = document.createElement('div');\n      div.innerHTML = `<span class=\"text-neutral-600\">${timeStr}</span> ${message}`;\n      terminalBody.appendChild(div);\n      // Auto scroll terminal window\n      terminalBody.parentElement.scrollTop = terminalBody.parentElement.scrollHeight;\n    }\n\n    // Trigger Dynamic System Pulse Button Click Event\n    function simulatePulse() {\n      logEvent(\"Manual trigger pulse initiated.\");\n      bars.forEach(bar => {\n        bar.style.height = '100%';\n      });\n      setTimeout(() => {\n        logEvent(\"Optimized telemetry echo success (RTT <1.2ms).\");\n      }, 300);\n    }\n  </script>\n\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "aether-real-time-telemetry-engine.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/staff-featured-2026-05-22/aether-real-time-telemetry-engine.jpg", "source_name": "aether-real-time-telemetry-engine-DESIGN.md", "views": 124, "forks": 3, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "1a62ed4c-6d0d-4900-8de2-1f3139579949", "created_at": "2026-06-12T07:38:10.793894+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T23:16:56.67738+00:00"}